                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "No Michigander should have to struggle to get the mental health care or addiction treatment they need.\n \nThat\u2019s why I worked to secure federal funding to help New Paths make critical improvements to its facilities and serve more residents. https://t.co/dQ6z9b78MJ",
