                "retweet_count": 1493,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I\u2019m still recovering from last week\u2019s cancer treatment, but I had to be at the Capitol to vote NO against the Republican default bill that would eliminate American jobs, hurt our economy and take away health care from veterans. https://t.co/K6CbBobGbX",
