                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 19,
                "source": "TweetDeck",
                "text": "I'm working with Republicans and Democrats to introduce the VET PFAS Act\u2014new bipartisan legislation to support our veterans.\n\nThe VA must cover treatment for service members who have health conditions linked to PFAS chemical exposure.\n\nWatch live:",
