                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "We make a promise to our servicemembers that we\u2019ll take care of them when they get home. But many veterans exposed to PFAS chemicals can\u2019t get proper treatment.\n\nI\u2019ve introduced a bill that would get our veterans the care they deserve. https://t.co/dScU2lsTIP",
