                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Funding I secured will help the Bay County Health Department transform an abandoned building into a one-stop health care facility.\n\u00a0\nBay County families will be able to access primary care services, substance abuse treatment programs & talk with social workers all under one roof. https://t.co/paw9ou2ExC",
