                "text": "It was an honor to be presented with the Lifetime Achievement Award at the 2024 National PFAS Conference in Ann Arbor. \n\nI look forward to continuing our work to clean up these PFAS toxins and ensure all those who have been exposed get access to the care and treatment they need. https://t.co/7UIvRIBwZ8",
