                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Too many families struggle to get the care they need to address substance use disorders.\n\nI'm proud to have secured funding for specialty treatment and recovery courts in my district to give veterans and others a second chance and the opportunity to address these issues head on. https://t.co/3mGcC7rtGS",
